        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An employee who is receiving temporary disability payments and supplemental sick leave or vacation as described in Section B above is considered on regular pay status for purposes of application of provisions of this Agreement, except completion of the probationary period. Sick leave and vacation earned during this period may be used as soon as credited.",
