            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "An employee on leave without pay and receiving temporary disability payments earns sick leave and vacation on the same basis as if regularly employed, but such sick leave and vacation is credited to the employee only upon return to work. If an employee separates without returning to work, no payment shall be made for such vacation credit.",
